cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GlidieBirdie: A Zero-Dependency, Fixed-Step 720 Hz Deterministic Browser Game Architecture with Procedural Web Audio, WCAG 2.2 AA Accessibility, and Lean 4 Verification"
message: "If you cite or build upon GlidieBirdie's deterministic browser architecture, test harness, or Lean 4 formalization, please cite this metadata."
type: software
version: "3.2.0"
date-released: "2026-11-26"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/0thernes/glidiebirdie"
url: "https://0thernes.github.io/glidiebirdie/"
abstract: >-
  Zero-runtime-dependency, no-bundler browser flyer built in 20 native ES2022 modules
  using a 60 Hz fixed-step integrator quantized on a 720 Hz tick grid, paired with
  procedural Web Audio, automated 4-view WCAG 2.2 AA accessibility checks, 55 zero-Mathlib
  Lean 4.35.0 formal theorems (6 kernels + live negative tamper check), 2,000-case
  fuzzing, 12/12 surgical mutation testing, and an AMS-LaTeX Build White Paper.
  Developed with AI engineering assistance under human direction; not peer reviewed.
authors:
